no cookie: 200 "no preference" Set-Cookie=-
with the cookie: 200 "show_done is 1" Set-Cookie=-
set it: 200 "saved" Set-Cookie=show_done=1; Path=/; Secure; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax
remove it: 200 "saved" Set-Cookie=show_done=; Path=/; Max-Age=0; Secure; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax
a value a cookie cannot hold: 500 {"type":"about:blank","title":"Internal Server Error","status":500} Set-Cookie=-
